      "funding_type": "grant",
      "typical_award_size": "FY 2026-27 Urban County entitlements requested by jurisdiction: CDBG $2,948,080 (County share $1,740,858; Escalon $75,000; Lathrop $97,358; Manteca $420,911; Ripon $92,270; Tracy $521,683), HOME $973,290 (County share $663,627) and ESG $258,552, plus about $500,000 CDBG and $500,000 HOME program income. County HOME rental awards in 2026-27: DCDC Senior Housing at Salas Park (Lodi Commons) $230,024 entitlement plus $500,000 program income; STAND solar for permanent supportive shared housing $190,281; CHDO set-aside $145,993. Historic averages per the division: CDBG about $2.4 million a year, HOME about $700,000 a year, ESG about $200,000 a year.",
      "per_unit_cap": "No local cap published; HOME subsidy limits per 24 CFR 92.250 apply.",
